# Screenshot Directory

This directory contains automated screenshots for documentation.

Generated by running: npm run screenshots

Screenshots are organized by feature:
- authentication/
- dashboard/
- pipeline/
- logs/
- artifacts/
- projects/
- keyboard-shortcuts/
- responsive/
- components/

For details on the screenshot workflow, see:
- SCREENSHOT_SETUP.md (overview)
- docs/SCREENSHOT_WORKFLOW.md (detailed guide)
- docs/SCREENSHOTS_README.md (quick reference)
